  "remarks": "JSC Petersburg Social Commercial Bank is one of the largest banks in the Northwest Federal District of the Russian Federation. It is one of the leading banks in Saint-Petersburg in the area of international business. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC Petersburg Social Commercial Bank is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
